+   * top of the shaded picture. Compositing the panel into a 2x nearest
+   * upscale of the field and shading THAT made the chain see 2x2 blocks as
+   * source pixels: the game behind the menu looked unshaded/blocky while
+   * the shader was applied to the panel's text instead. */
